From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:37:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07/17] List the data directories side by side when starting

Listing a directory tree is many small file system calls, slow on Android storage, and a big mod list has hundreds of
data directories. They are independent, so they are listed on several threads and added in their original order.
---
